flowchart TB
accTitle: Transfer the large baseline separately from the small change stream
accDescr: A consistent 25 TB baseline travels through Data Transfer Terminal and S3 into Aurora while the source retains binlogs. Those changes catch up over the VPN before a brief write pause and cutover.
M[(On-premises MySQL<br/>Continue serving writes)]:::storage -->|Consistent 25 TB baseline| B[Backup plus exact binlog position]:::process
B --> T[Data Transfer Terminal<br/>Upload baseline to S3]:::process
T --> A[(Restore Aurora MySQL)]:::storage
M -->|Retained binlogs<br/>50 Mbps VPN| A
A --> V[Brief write pause<br/>Final catch-up and validation]:::process
V --> C[Application cutover]:::output
